    "description": "Best SellingCLX ENet/IP 100MCatalog #: 1756-EN2TLifecycle status: Active The Allen-Bradley 1756-EN2T is a ControlLogix Ethernet/IP Communication Module designed to connect Allen-Bradley ControlLogix PLCs to an Ethernet/IP network. It provides high-speed communication between the PLC system and other Ethernet/IP-enabled devices.Key Features of the 1756-EN2T:\n\nEthernet/IP Communication: It provides high-speed Ethernet/IP communication between ControlLogix controllers and other devices on the Ethernet network, such as remote I/O, HMIs (Human-Machine Interfaces), and other controllers.\n\n\nDual-port Ethernet: The module includes two Ethernet ports, which can be used for network redundancy. This helps to ensure communication continues in the event of a network failure on one port.\n\n\nHigh-Speed Data Transfer: The module supports fast data exchange, making it suitable for real-time industrial applications that require high throughput.\n\n\nSecurity: The 1756-EN2T provides features for network security, such as user authentication, to ensure that only authorized devices can connect to the system.\n\n\nFull Integration with ControlLogix Systems: The 1756-EN2T is fully integrated into the Allen-Bradley ControlLogix architecture, allowing easy configuration and diagnostics through Studio 5000 programming software.\n\n\nDevice-Level Ring (DLR) Support: This module supports Device-Level Ring for Ethernet networks, providing automatic recovery in case of network failures, reducing downtime.",
