    "description": "Description:\nSiemens SIMATIC HMI SMART 700 IE V4 Touch Panel, Model 6AV6648-0DC11-3AX0, designed for industrial automation and machine control applications. It features a 7-inch TFT widescreen touch display with Ethernet and RS422/485 communication ports for easy connectivity with Siemens PLCs and other automation devices. Compact design, reliable performance, and user-friendly operation make it ideal for OEM machines, process control, packaging, textile, and conveyor systems. Compatible with WinCC Flexible SMART software for easy configuration and monitoring. \nMain Features\n\n\n7 Inch TFT Touch Display\n\n\nResolution: 800 &times; 480 Pixels\n\n\nEthernet RJ45 Communication\n\n\nRS422/RS485 Serial Port\n\n\nUSB Host Port\n\n\n24V DC Supply\n\n\nCompact Panel Mount Design\n\n\nCompatible with Siemens S7 Series PLCs\n\n\nEasy Programming with WinCC Flexible SMART\n\n\nApplications\n\n\nPackaging Machines\n\n\nIndustrial Automation\n\n\nWater Treatment Plants\n\n\nTextile Machinery\n\n\nConveyor Systems\n\n\nOEM Control Panels\n\n\n\n\nSpecificationSiemens SIMATIC HMI SMART 700 IE\n\n\nModel No\n6AV6648-0DC11-3AX0\n\n\nDisplay Size\n7 Inch\n\n\nDisplay Type\nTFT Touch Screen\n\n\nResolution\n800 &times; 480\n\n\nCommunication\nEthernet + RS422/485\n\n\nPower Supply\n24V DC\n\n\nMounting Type\nPanel Mount\n\n\nApprox Weight\n0.96 Kg\n\n\nSoftware\nWinCC Flexible SMART",
