    "description": "6SL3210-1PE32-5AL0 SINAMICS G120 PM240-2 Power Module\nThe 6SL3210-1PE32-5AL0 is a high-performance SINAMICS G120 PM240-2 power module designed for demanding industrial applications requiring reliable and efficient motor control. This robust drive module is equipped with a built-in Class A EMC filter and braking chopper, ensuring smooth operation, reduced electrical interference, and improved braking performance.\nIt supports a wide input voltage range of 3-phase 380&ndash;480V AC and delivers high overload capability, making it ideal for heavy-duty operations such as conveyors, pumps, compressors, and material handling systems. The module offers a power rating of up to 132 kW (low overload) and 110 kW (high overload), ensuring flexibility across various industrial applications. (RS Components)\nDesigned with advanced thermal management and compact frame size (FSF), this unit ensures long service life and consistent performance even in harsh industrial environments. Please note that this is a power module and requires a compatible control unit (CU) for operation.\n�� Key Features    \n\n\nPower Module PM240-2 (SINAMICS G120 Series)\n\n\nInput: 3 Phase, 380&ndash;480V AC\n\n\nOutput Power: 110 kW (HO) / 132 kW (LO)\n\n\nBuilt-in EMC filter (Class A)\n\n\nIntegrated braking chopper\n\n\nHigh overload capacity for heavy-duty applications\n\n\nCompact design with IP20 protection\n\n\nSuitable for industrial automation systems\n\n\n�� Applications    \n\n\nConveyor systems\n\n\nPumps &amp; fans\n\n\nCrushers &amp; mixers\n\n\nMaterial handling equipment\n\n\nTextile &amp; process industries\n\n\n�� Additional Information    \n\n\nBrand: Siemens\n\n\nModel No.: 6SL3210-1PE32-5AL0\n\n\nSeries: SINAMICS G120 PM240-2\n\n\nCondition: New / Unused\n\n\nCountry of Origin: Germany\n\n\nControl Unit: Not included (sold separately) (Industry Mall)",
